# experiment: tip-p22-pin-below-threshold — FFM 으로 C qsort 호출, upcall 비교 함수 안 Thread.sleep 으로 Native frame pinning 을 만든다. short: VT 8개×(원소 6개, 비교마다 sleep 5ms), long: VT 1개×(원소 3개, 비교마다 sleep 25ms). (A) settings=default(threshold 20 ms) (B) settings=default + jdk.VirtualThreadPinned#threshold=0ms (C) JFR 녹화 없이 Micrometer VirtualThreadMetrics 만. 세 경우 모두 micrometer-java21 1.17.1 VirtualThreadMetrics(pinned threshold 20 ms 고정) 를 같은 JVM 에 붙인다. 3회
# java -version:
#   openjdk version "26.0.2.1" 2026-08-18
#   OpenJDK Runtime Environment (build 26.0.2.1+1-7)
#   OpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM (build 26.0.2.1+1-7, mixed mode, sharing)
# kotlinc -version: info: kotlinc-jvm 2.3.20 (JRE 26.0.2.1+1-7)  ("/Applications/IntelliJ IDEA.app/Contents/plugins/Kotlin/kotlinc/bin/kotlinc" -version 실출력)
# deps: micrometer-core/commons/observation 1.17.1 (gradle 캐시), HdrHistogram 2.2.2 (gradle 캐시), micrometer-java21 1.17.1 (Maven Central)
# machine: Apple M5 Pro (arm64), hw.ncpu=15
# date: 2026-10-08 10:42:13 KST
# load: 7.33 7.37 6.29  (다른 실험이 같은 기기에서 동시에 돌 수 있어 절대 ms 는 부하를 탄다)
# command: java --enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED [-XX:StartFlightRecording=filename=pin-X.jfr,settings=default[,jdk.VirtualThreadPinned#threshold=0ms]] -cp <micrometer-core/commons/observation 1.17.1, HdrHistogram 2.2.2, micrometer-java21 1.17.1> PinBelowThreshold.java ; jfr summary pin-X.jfr | grep VirtualThreadPinned ; jfr print --json --events jdk.VirtualThreadPinned pin-X.jfr | jfrsum.py
